{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_animation":true,"content_width":"custom","custom_content_width":700}},"rich_text_qaL9kY":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_8xVjdw":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Natural Variations In Shells","heading_tag":"h1","heading_font_class":"fs-heading-1-base"}},"text_FzQBtT":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Because our shells are genuine creations of the sea, each one carries its own unique character. Variations may occur in:<\/p>","text_font_class":"fs-body-100"}}},"block_order":["heading_8xVjdw","text_FzQBtT"],"name":"t:sections.rich_text.presets.name","settings":{"alignment":"center_center","enable_animation":true,"divider_style":"none","section_padding":"section--vertical-padding-top-only","content_width":"full","custom_content_width":700,"background_color":"#fefaf1","text_color":"#5c5451","cutsom_class":"mobile-md-heading heading-linehight spacing-bottom-10"}},"multi_column_mnEx64":{"type":"multi-column","blocks":{"image_column_YebjFp":{"type":"image_column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/286f608d1879f9f019fdc02e463fa8423e836739_1.jpg","image_width":100,"aspect_ratio":"natural","enable_image_crop_circle":false,"focal_point":"image_presentation","image_position":"above_text","image_link":"","small_caption":"","accent":"","heading":"Size","heading_tag":"h3","heading_font_class":"fs-heading-4-base","text":"<p>Shells develop under varying conditions shaped by tides, currents, and their natural environment. As a result, their dimensions may differ slightly, even within the same style or category. Some pieces may be a little larger or smaller, adding to their unique character and ensuring no two are ever identical. To guide selection, we group shells into size ranges, for example, 5 to 7 cm, so customers receive shells of comparable proportions.<\/p>","text_font_class":"fs-body-100","text_max_width":100,"link":"","link_text":"","button_style":"btn--primary"}},"image_column_HDqURm":{"type":"image_column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/82ce849acdd00ffa457154052bf97d9df757ab47.jpg","image_width":100,"aspect_ratio":"natural","enable_image_crop_circle":false,"focal_point":"image_presentation","image_position":"above_text","image_link":"","small_caption":"","accent":"","heading":"Colour","heading_tag":"h3","heading_font_class":"fs-heading-4-base","text":"<p>As natural products, shells will show differences in colour. These variations occur naturally and are part of what makes each shell distinctive. No two pieces will ever be exactly the same, which is part of their charm and authenticity.<\/p>","text_font_class":"fs-body-100","text_max_width":100,"link":"","link_text":"","button_style":"btn--primary"}},"image_column_xyDAWH":{"type":"image_column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/dbeeb4c2f068dca841ef1af33729d9be4c0fe614.jpg","image_width":100,"aspect_ratio":"natural","enable_image_crop_circle":false,"focal_point":"image_presentation","image_position":"above_text","image_link":"","small_caption":"","accent":"","heading":"Texture","heading_tag":"h3","heading_font_class":"fs-heading-4-base","text":"<p>The surface of each shell tells its own story. Ridges, grooves, and markings are shaped by the shell’s journey in the ocean, whether smoothed by waves, marked by sand, or patterned by growth. These tactile details make every shell distinctive and add depth and authenticity to its appearance.<\/p>","text_font_class":"fs-body-100","text_max_width":100,"link":"","link_text":"","button_style":"btn--primary"}},"image_column_pyVwzx":{"type":"image_column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/51686954ead86e500fab1459f1a4135464cdad0d.jpg","image_width":100,"aspect_ratio":"natural","enable_image_crop_circle":false,"focal_point":"image_presentation","image_position":"above_text","image_link":"","small_caption":"","accent":"","heading":"Shape","heading_tag":"h3","heading_font_class":"fs-heading-4-base","text":"<p>No two shells form identically. Variations in curves, edges, and contours are natural outcomes of their growth. Some may be more rounded, others elongated or slightly asymmetrical. These differences highlight the organic nature of the product and ensure every shell is truly one‑of‑a‑kind.<\/p>","text_font_class":"fs-body-100","text_max_width":100,"link":"","link_text":"","button_style":"btn--primary"}}},"block_order":["image_column_YebjFp","image_column_HDqURm","image_column_xyDAWH","image_column_pyVwzx"],"custom_css":[],"name":"t:sections.multi_column.presets.name","settings":{"title":"","heading_tag":"h2","heading_font_class":"fs-heading-3-base","subheading":"","heading_alignment":"center","content_vertical_alignment":"top","content_background_padding":"medium","columns":"2","column_spacing":37,"row_spacing":37,"column_alignment":"center","enable_slider_mobile":false,"columns_mobile":"1","column_spacing_mobile":48,"row_spacing_mobile":50,"column_alignment_mobile":"center","background_behind_columns":false,"background_color":"#fefaf1","text_color":"#5c5451","button_background_color":"#000000","button_text_color":"#ffffff","enable_animation":true,"divider_style":"none","section_padding":"section--vertical-padding-top-bottom","cutsom_class":"small-heading mobile-bs-size"}},"rich_text_A4P4wy":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_KUA644":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Pricing","heading_tag":"h2","heading_font_class":"fs-heading-3-base"}},"text_8JYTke":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>As a natural, seasonally collected product, shell availability can fluctuate throughout the year. Changes in harvest conditions, supply volumes, and global demand can affect the cost of each incoming shipment. Pricing may therefore vary from delivery to delivery, aligning with current market conditions and ensuring we maintain consistent quality and responsible sourcing.<\/p>","text_font_class":"fs-body-100"}}},"block_order":["heading_KUA644","text_8JYTke"],"custom_css":["h2 {font-size: 30px;}"],"name":"t:sections.rich_text.presets.name","settings":{"alignment":"center_center","enable_animation":true,"divider_style":"none","section_padding":"section--vertical-padding-top-bottom","content_width":"full","custom_content_width":1000,"background_color":"#fefaf1","text_color":"#5c5451","cutsom_class":""}},"rich_text_La7TH7":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"text_YibmGp":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>These variations are not imperfections, they are proof of authenticity and a hallmark of natural products.<\/p>","text_font_class":"fs-body-100"}}},"block_order":["text_YibmGp"],"name":"t:sections.rich_text.presets.name","settings":{"alignment":"center_center","enable_animation":true,"divider_style":"none","section_padding":"section--vertical-padding-top-bottom","content_width":"full","custom_content_width":700,"background_color":"#fefaf1","text_color":"#5c5451","cutsom_class":""}}},"order":["main","rich_text_qaL9kY","multi_column_mnEx64","rich_text_A4P4wy","rich_text_La7TH7"]}